<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.  9.</td>', 'Lovely, airy image that epitomizes Greece.  So it''s more than the typical architecture, in bright blue and white, but the expanse of that great culture spread out before us.  The darker blue of the sea beyond, and the rocky, jutting land, is seen from above, as if by the gods.  I love how the sea and sky mingle at the horizon, beckoning.  It''s as much about the architecture of the world as of this church.Personal favorite of the challenge.  9.', '2021-06-24 01:24:38.000000', NULL, 0),
